/**
 * SQLite's constants and the facts of one wasm build.
 *
 * Generated by `scripts/generate.mts` from the string
 * `sqlite3__wasm_enum_json()` returns and the binary's exports, pinned in
 * `scripts/upstream/sqlite3-wasm-enum.json` and
 * `scripts/upstream/sqlite3-wasm-exports.json`. Do not edit.
 *
 * SQLite's constants never change, but {@link SQLITE_WASM_DEALLOC}, the struct
 * layouts and the version belong to the build. The loader fails unless the
 * binary it loads has the {@link sqliteWasmBuildHash} of the pinned one, so
 * these values always describe the binary that runs.
 *
 * @module
 */

